chuva - API to access KNMI's rain forecast models

Models are laid out in RAM so that the performance of answering
"what's the rain forecast for the next 2h for a given lat,lon point"
can be measured in nanoseconds instead of seconds

SUPPORTED MODELS

   Nowcast (radar-forecast, version 2.0): https://dataplatform.knmi.nl/dataset/radar-forecast-2-0

   Ensemble (seamless_precipitation_ensemble_forecast_members, version 1.0): https://dataplatform.knmi.nl/dataset/seamless-precipitation-ensemble-forecast-members-1-0
